---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import site from "../../data/site.json";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`The story behind ${site.businessName}.`}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Our Story</h1>
      <p>
        Food was never just about necessity in my family. It was a means of spending time
        together, giving thanks, showing love, and sometimes a warm apology. My mom would spend
        several hours of her precious days off cooking dinner for my family. I never understood
        why she'd pour so much effort into a single dinner until one day, during my junior year of
        high school, I decided to bake cookies for my friends.
      </p>
      <p>
        Their eyes lit up and smiles erupted at their first bite. I was hooked. Cookies and
        brownies became a daily thing. Only then did I understand why my mom would work so hard
        to gift my family with a delicious meal. Now I'm hoping to use my baking skills to provide
        the same deliciousness, joy, and care my mom has given me.
      </p>
      <p>
        {site.businessName} operates as a licensed home-based cottage food operation. That means
        smaller batches, a shorter menu, and a lot more attention paid to each item that goes out
        the door.
      </p>
      <p>
        Have a question, a special request, or want to place an order? Reach out any time at{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
</style>
